{"availability":"available","full":"clarenceinnov/howsdaweather","name":"howsdaweather","description":"Postcode-precise UK weather forecast. Reads the terrain around your exact spot (valleys, frost hollows, hilltops), blends 156 ensemble members from 5 national weather centres incl. the Met Office, and verifies itself against real rain gauges. Free, no ads, no tracking.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-08T20:03:24Z","updated":"2026-10-10T08:09:21Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://howsdaweather.netlify.app/","topics":["ensemble-forecasting","forecasting","free","frost-hollow","hyperlocal","javascript","met-office","meterology","no-backend","open-meteo","postcode","progressive-web-app","pwa","rain-forecast","static-site","uk","uk-weather","weather","weather-app","weather-forecast"],"demo":"https://howsdaweather.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.460Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.460Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.460Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.460Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live app: howsdaweather.netlify.app - free, no ads, no accounts, no tracking. Works on any phone or laptop, installs as an app (PWA).","Most weather apps forecast for your nearest city. HowsDaWeather forecasts for your full postcode - pinned to within about 100 metres - and then reads the shape of the land around that exact spot, because a valley floor, a hilltop and a plain at the same \"location\" get three different kinds of weather. On top of that sit methodologies most apps simply do not use: a 156-member ensemble from five national weather centres (including the UK Met Office's own model) weighted by proven skill, and a forecast that checks itself against real rain gauges before asking for your trust.","Then it answers the questions you actually have: Can I hang the washing out? Will the school run stay dry? Is it BBQ weather?"],"features":["A forecast for your exact spot - your postcode, your valley, your hilltop - not the city up the road that gets different weather.","A more reliable UK rain forecast - many independent models, weighted by how good each has proven to be, never a single model's opinion.","Honest uncertainty - a confidence score that means something, explains itself, and is checked against what actually fell out of the sky.","Fun - a \"Word for the day\" (STUNNER, DREICH, TOSS-UP, SCORCHIO), punny activity advice, and release notes that admit it when we got something wrong.","Free for everyone, forever - zero operating cost by design, so it never needs ads, subscriptions or your data."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clarenceinnov/howsdaweather/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a8f581c59d421b253ab2b09452494d1019297549871242fcd87e498e544a8b8f","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.561Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.561Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live app: howsdaweather.netlify.app - free, no ads, no accounts, no tracking. Works on any phone or laptop, installs as an app (PWA).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clarenceinnov/howsdaweather/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Live app: howsdaweather.netlify.app - free, no ads, no accounts, no tracking.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clarenceinnov/howsdaweather/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Netlify Drop (no account needed): drag the folder onto app.netlify.com/drop.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clarenceinnov/howsdaweather/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a8f581c59d421b253ab2b09452494d1019297549871242fcd87e498e544a8b8f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clarenceinnov/howsdaweather/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.561Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T08:09:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"stat